# Ajani Resolute: his 0 and a Lightning Helix bring him from 2 to 4 loyalty on turn 1, so on turn 3 the -4 is offered (the
# refusal at 3 is in the scenario beside this one): it creates a 2/2 white Cat Soldier token named Ajani's Pridemate and Ajani,
# at 0 loyalty, goes to the graveyard (CR 704.5i). The token outlives him, and a second Helix then puts a +1/+1 counter on it:
# "Whenever you gain life" is the token's own ability (CR 603.2), so it grows to 3/3 (and a Helix by Bot2 would not).
